"P1981034264" "You fended off the Arachnos ambush!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3068121647" "Hey, I know what you are thinking, you want to beat me into a pulp right now... but let me explain.<br><br>Lt. Fossil wanted you dead, and he has information on lots of us Arachnos soldiers that could get us thrown in the brig, or worse. He waited until you contacted one of us and then blackmailed us into setting you up into that ambush. I know you will probably never trust me again, but if you want to take the risk, I can tell you which base Lt. Fossil is working in right now. He won't be expecting the likes of you to show up. You could beat him seven ways 'til Sunday for what he tried to do to you. I think you'd agree that this would be an excellent plan."
// RandomFameString :
"P3846014408" "I heard someone in Arachnos tried to take out {HeroName} out of jealousy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL2.5_Johnson_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1815275228" "OK, here is the plan. Lt. Fossil is holed up in Port Oakes. He's in a base ordering his men around. He normally doesn't get his hands dirty, as you know combat can be dangerous. He usually just throws subordinates at the problem until the problem goes away. However, he can't resist a 'big score' on his record. If you were to pose as a Paragon Hero while taking down his base, he would most definitely try to take you down himself."
// AcceptString :
"P2685375657" "Pose as a Hero to trap Lt. Fossil"
// SendOffString :
"P208478897" "Ok, this image inducer should make you appear as a hero to the sensors in the base."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3323359743" "Deceive and defeat Lt. Fossil"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1653876482" "You need to take down that blackmailer, show him who really runs things around here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3420743695" "The disguise is working, the base's automated defense systems see you as an invading Paragon Hero."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P511367753" "You showed Fossil you were the real deal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1280684444" "Great job! Lt. Fossil seems to be in a coma after all the hurt you put down on him. He won't be talking to anyone for a long time, plus I think his plans to take you down are at an end."
// RandomFameString :
"P2881580461" "I heard some Hero from Paragon City beat the tar out of Lt. Fossil."
